&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:13pt;"&gt;80,850千円&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:13pt;min-height:13pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;"&gt;短期金銭債務&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;border-top-color:#a9a9a9;border-bottom-color:#a9a9a9;border-left-color:#a9a9a9;border-right-color:#a9a9a9;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:13pt;"&gt;9,569千円&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:top;overflow:hidden;" valign="top"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;line-height:13pt;"&gt;2,481千円&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAssetsAndLiabilitiesIncurredFromTransactionsWithAffiliatedEntitiesTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:DebtorsNotesRegardingOverdraftContractsAndOrLoanCommitmentsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27.3pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:-18.3pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;２　当社は、運転資金の効率的な調達を行うため、取引銀行４行（前事業年度は７行）と当座貸越契約を締結しております。当座貸越契約は次のとおりであります。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:30.1pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:436.6pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
